OL,3,GNEWSANew Battersea Power Station
OL,4,Amasterplan unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FFresh proposals have been submitted for
OL,7,Fthe second half of the Battersea Power
OL,8,FStation regeneration project, updating
OL,9,Fa masterplan that is more than 15 years
OL,10,Fold.
OL,12,FThe new planning application, submitted
OL,13,Fby the Battersea Power Station
OL,14,FDevelopment Company (BPSDC) to
OL,15,FWandsworth Council, outlines up to 3.2
OL,16,Fmillion sq ft (297,000 sq m) of
OL,17,Fresidential, commercial and leisure
OL,18,Fspace.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
