OL,3,GNEWSANew Battersea Power Station
OL,4,Amasterplan unveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FDevelopers say the revised scheme
OL,7,Freflects shifts in how people live,
OL,8,Fwork and spend their leisure time,
OL,9,Faccelerated by events such as the
OL,10,FCovid-19 pandemic.
OL,12,FIf approved, it will nearly double the
OL,13,Fscale of development delivered so far.
